MAINLEN  DC    Y(GETLINE-NCAT)  length of mainline code                 00044700
GETLINE  STM   R14,R12,12(R13)  save registers                          00044800
         USING GETLINE,R15      tell assembler of temporary base        00044900
         ST    R13,REGSTGET+4   chain ..                                00045000
