                        PP            RR    RR           TT       AA        AA           SSS  MM        MM
                       PP            RR     RR          TT       AA        AA            SS  MM        MM
                      PP            RR      RR         TT       AA        AA  SS        SS  MM        MM
                     PP            RR       RR        TT       AA        AA  SSSSSSSSSSSS  MM        MM
